! Exercise tab expansion in outputStatement(), which runs the label and
! math sections through edit(...,2048) when reformatting.  No other test
! .mm file contains a tab, and neither does set.mm, so this is the only
! coverage of that path.
verify proof *
write source untab-rewrapped.mm /rewrap
tools
type untab-rewrapped.mm
exit
show statement ax1
